! _post-guide

COMPA_HDW_LeftWall / COMPA_HDW_RightWall
! Inlet walls (Z points inwards at beginning inlet, outwards at ending inlet):
! ✅  - Bending moment MY (about horizontal axis)
! ✅  - Bending moment MX (about vertical axis)
! ✅  - Shear force
! ✅  - Axial force NY (vertical)
! ✅  - Axial force NX (horizontal)
! ⌚  - Deflection
